generator_json.vlt:11:13: error: cannot convert to or from JSON: `Generator<i64, never>` is a generator
TypeScript allows this (`JSON.stringify` writes a generator as `{}`); Velt doesn't because a generator is a paused computation, not data; write the values it yields instead (collect them into an array with `for...of`)
generator_json.vlt:12:13: error: cannot convert to or from JSON: `AsyncGenerator<i64, never>[]` contains the generator `AsyncGenerator<i64, never>`
TypeScript allows this (`JSON.stringify` writes a generator as `{}`); Velt doesn't because a generator is a paused computation, not data; write the values it yields instead (collect them into an array with `for...of`)
